  "howto": [
   "**Buy low**: players on other teams scoring *less* than their work is worth (**PPG − xPPG**, points minus expected points per game, below zero). Their manager sees a bad box score; the work says it should turn around. **Sell high**: your players scoring *more* than their work supports.",
